{"id":"hue_sped","lemma":"huésped","pos":"noun","rank":3042,"glosses":["guest (recipient of hospitality)","lodger (person who lodges in another's house)","host (cell or organism which harbors another organism)"],"ipa":"/ˈw̝esped/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"huéspedes","feminine":"huésped","femininePlural":"huéspedes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/db/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-hu%C3%A9sped.wav","examples":[{"text":"Nuestros huéspedes tienen prisa.","en":"Our guests are in a hurry.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611908","words":[{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"hurry, rush, urgency"}]},{"text":"¿Cuántos huéspedes hay?","en":"How many guests are there?","words":[{"g":"how much","l":"cuánto"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"haber"}]},{"text":"Los huéspedes deben de estar por llegar pronto.","en":"The guests should be arriving soon.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"to arrive, get"},{"g":"prompt, on time"}]},{"text":"Este hotel puede alojar a 500 huéspedes.","en":"This hotel can accommodate 500 guests.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152100","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"hotel"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to house, accommodate"},{"g":"to"},null]},{"text":"Este hotel tiene alojamiento para 1000 huéspedes.","en":"This hotel has accommodations for 1,000 guests.","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"hotel"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"accommodation"},{"g":"for"},null]}]}